# Audit (P10.2) — demo requests (VS / Rider / VS Code REST Client).
#
# Sensitive actions (settings, faculty overrides, accounts, grade confirm/publish/correct, office payments, device
# decisions, timetable edits) are logged after their commit. Student Affairs reads them newest first.

@host = http://localhost:5080
@adminToken = paste-the-admin-token-here
@userId = paste-a-user-id-here

### Everything, newest first (paged)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/activity?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### One account's history (created, status changed, password reset …)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/activity?entityType=user&entityId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Timetable edits in a window
GET {{host}}/api/admin/activity?entityType=schedule_slot&from=2026-10-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-10-31T23:59:59Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
